    "description": "<p>Personal boundaries shiver and fall after dedicated carousing, and it is not uncommon for a party's escapees to forget that others aren't quite as relaxed. Uninhibited touching is the order of the day until the recipients point out that it is unwelcome. And sometimes even then. Activating this Charm, the character may make two clinches simultaneously, rather than having to seize two victims on consecutive actions. Each suffers a -5 multiple-action penalty, but the character may reduce the penalty of each separately, to a minimum of -2, for each point of penalty she suffers due to indulgence.</p>",
